### Order Processing System — sample requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, JetBrains Rider and Visual Studio.
### Start the stack first:  docker compose up --build -d

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health (gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create an order with multiple items
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-KEYBOARD", "productName": "Mechanical keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 89.99 },
    { "productId": "SKU-MOUSE", "productName": "Wireless mouse", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 24.50 }
  ]
}

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### Get the order by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### List all orders (newest first, paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20

### List orders filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=PENDING

### List a customer's orders filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId=cust-1001&status=PROCESSING

### Cancel (only allowed while PENDING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Move to the next status: PENDING -> PROCESSING -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PROCESSING" }

### Illegal transition (e.g. PENDING -> DELIVERED) returns 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### Validation error: no items -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "cust-1001", "items": [] }

### Internal job endpoint is NOT exposed through the gateway -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/jobs/promote-pending
